{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>וחניתי, מצבה</b> — bet in place of alef. The meaning is אחנה ואנוח מצבא (I will camp and rest from an army) that will come, and [from] one passing through. The meaning is: there is no one who will come to do harm to Jerusalem, for all its surroundings are servants of HaShem and servants of Israel. And the meaning of כי עתה is the word of the prophet who saw this now in visions, in the eyes of prophecy."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "The reading עובדי השם ועובדי ישראל (servants of HaShem and servants of Israel) is unusual; possible textual difficulty retained hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:31.186554567Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}